  "overview": "The Sega Saturn Approach... Golf the way it was meant to be played!\n\n- 3 different golf views including Ball Cam - which follows the shot from the ball perspective.\n- Detailed audio & strategy narrated by Craig Stadler.\n- 7 Play Modes: Tournament, Skins, Match Play, and More!\n- Track Individual & Course Records, Hole-by-Hole Scoring Averages, Handicaps, and Miracle shots.\n- Create your own players and challenge Craig Stadler on the links!\n- Custom Select your own set of clubs."
